The result is not yet shippable: OpenRouter returned HTTP 403 “Key limit exceeded” for every bare and G9 call, so the transcripts contain only API errors and no hardness verdict. No `REJECTED.md` was created because this is an infrastructure blocker, not a paper or family failure.

